{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John, something awesome happened since we talked. I made a game avatar and joined a new platform. It's so fun exploring and chatting with other gamers - it's a whole new adventure every time! I feel like I'm part of a super cool online community."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-2c7b46f6b5483b44ff61cc81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:13.973875+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c7b46f6b5483b44ff61cc81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c7b46f6b5483b44ff61cc81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, awesome! Glad you're enjoying it and connecting with others. Building a community is really cool, especially when you meet people who enjoy the same things."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-a524d182f847cbb981de6306", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.013337+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a524d182f847cbb981de6306", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a524d182f847cbb981de6306", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks, John! Connecting with other gamers has been great! We've shared tips, strategies, and stories about gaming. It's amazing how it brings people together, regardless of their backgrounds."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-1c1296e663e356ba809426ef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.036117+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1c1296e663e356ba809426ef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1c1296e663e356ba809426ef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's incredible! It's so cool how gaming can bring people together and create a strong bond, regardless of their background."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-b5d82d7cc14ab4c65fd5d235", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.060750+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b5d82d7cc14ab4c65fd5d235", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b5d82d7cc14ab4c65fd5d235", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yeah, it's our shared language and passion. It's been a refuge for me in tough times."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-a0238288a4534079b077ea34", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.078651+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a0238288a4534079b077ea34", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a0238288a4534079b077ea34", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, gaming always helps me escape stress. It's amazing how it calms me down during tough times."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-ba4a2e4b13e9f78b6aaf8b5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.097871+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ba4a2e4b13e9f78b6aaf8b5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ba4a2e4b13e9f78b6aaf8b5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Games are my go-to when I'm feeling overwhelmed. It's like therapy. I can relax, forget my troubles, and get lost in another world."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-64e0fa23769e05a58fff11d2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.113672+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "64e0fa23769e05a58fff11d2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "64e0fa23769e05a58fff11d2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Gotcha. Gaming can be a great way to take a break and escape for a while. Anything new you've been into lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-e559ecf184deaa8f464bd078", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.134947+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e559ecf184deaa8f464bd078", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e559ecf184deaa8f464bd078", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Lately, I've been checking out different styles of it. It's been fun to try something fresh and test myself in other ways. What about you, John? Any new hobbies recently?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-0749b178276ffed6f5da9190", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.150947+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0749b178276ffed6f5da9190", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0749b178276ffed6f5da9190", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've been getting into a new hobby recently. I bought a metal detector and walk along the beaches looking for something worthwhile."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-4670a927547b4eb0930abc5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.170316+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4670a927547b4eb0930abc5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4670a927547b4eb0930abc5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Interesting, John! Sounds like an awesome immersive experience. Already found something interesting?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-98a197a2e190e7d2473cbf0e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.188227+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98a197a2e190e7d2473cbf0e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98a197a2e190e7d2473cbf0e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Mostly just bottle caps, but a couple of times I found coins, and once even a gold ring."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-a824ac5f4282cf5ecdb72ebd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.201402+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a824ac5f4282cf5ecdb72ebd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a824ac5f4282cf5ecdb72ebd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool, I wish you good luck in this matter! By the way, I've got something to show you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-587237d34e06bba37863fe4c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.217540+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "587237d34e06bba37863fe4c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "587237d34e06bba37863fe4c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Show me what you've got! What is it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-9020d1c7ce3e80d5867ac72e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.234280+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9020d1c7ce3e80d5867ac72e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9020d1c7ce3e80d5867ac72e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Check out this pic of my best buds having a blast in the park. They've brought so much joy to my life. My two dogs are the best pals ever, right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-1e465f8e0d0ae96b8ce44632", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.267058+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1e465f8e0d0ae96b8ce44632", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1e465f8e0d0ae96b8ce44632", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: They look like they're having a blast! Can they do any tricks?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-bfad38fdaee046211e041356", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.286953+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bfad38fdaee046211e041356", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bfad38fdaee046211e041356", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: They can do tricks like sit, stay, paw, and rollover. Here's a picture of Daisy waiting for a treat. I've done lots of training and they've picked it up fast. They're like my family."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-5305ee7e0cc6185b87f28458", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.307029+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5305ee7e0cc6185b87f28458", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5305ee7e0cc6185b87f28458", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Aww, they're adorable! Pets are the best - they must make life so much better. I want one so bad, but I'm not there yet. Someday!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-964cf966a576de9b5fd7995b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.324630+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "964cf966a576de9b5fd7995b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "964cf966a576de9b5fd7995b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: A pet would truly be great for you! They bring so much love and companionship. If you're interested, I can help find the perfect one for you - you'd make a great pet parent!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-b4342a66fee82f4061f332f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.339390+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4342a66fee82f4061f332f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4342a66fee82f4061f332f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cheers, James! Yeah, I'll keep that in mind. Appreciate the offer."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-78ea36a4176ab8b215b9e915", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.358297+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "78ea36a4176ab8b215b9e915", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "78ea36a4176ab8b215b9e915", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: No problem, John! Let me know whenever you need assistance. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_2-3177986a591faa0eba6ef7d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:14.373186+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3177986a591faa0eba6ef7d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3177986a591faa0eba6ef7d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
